脸：“在下是凌飞扬。凌云的凌，飞云掣电的飞，扬名的扬。”“哦。”诸葛明月煞有其事的点了点头，又严肃的问道，“你有事？”凌飞扬微笑道：“在下只是想请诸葛小姐用餐。”“哦，那不客气了，谢谢啊。胖子，子皓，我们吃。”说完，诸葛明月就招呼着万俟辰和薛子皓吃饭，完全无视站在桌边的凌飞扬。万俟辰瞟了眼凌飞扬，轻哼一声，毫不客气的开吃了。薛子皓犹豫了下，也开吃了。凌飞扬觉得自己脸上的笑快撑不下去了，但是还是努力撑着，但是就这么站在桌边，看着诸葛明月三人吃的香，他还是觉得再这样下去要破功了。第一次有人这样不给他面子，第一次啊第一次！“呵呵呵……”门口传来一阵戏谑的笑声，一脸冷峻的骆惊风出现在了门口，斜靠在了门上，双手环抱在胸前，揶揄的看着里面的场景。“你笑个屁。”凌飞扬黑着脸从牙缝中挤出几个字来。“你说对了，我还真就是在笑屁。”骆惊风歪着头，轻轻挑眉说了句。凌飞扬的脸更黑了。诸葛明月却是回头看着门口的人了，看着一脸戏谑笑容的骆惊风，诸葛明月轻轻扬眉。这人说话，有点意思。“那是骆惊风。”薛子皓小声的对诸葛明月说道。“诸葛小姐，不好意思。我的朋友太冒昧了，还望谅解。在下是骆惊风。”骆惊风缓缓走了进来，彬彬有礼的微笑着开口了。诸葛明月微微眯眼看着眼前的人，对于凌飞扬这样自以为是的人，诸葛明月不会客气。但是，对于骆惊风这种客气的人，她反倒不好意思为难了。“没有关系。”诸葛明月微微一笑，点了点头。“那么，打扰了。”骆惊风冲诸葛明月也点了点有，走到凌飞扬的旁边，掏出一个信封，“你的。”“我不是说了，不要随便替我收情书。”凌飞扬皱眉冷哼一声。“是凌家的紧急信件。”骆惊风慢吞吞的清晰的说道，声音不大不小，却刚好让屋子里的众人都听清楚。“哈哈……”诸葛明月丝毫不给面子的笑出了声。这个骆惊风，绝对是故意的，哈哈哈！凌飞扬脸色变得酱紫，猛的一把抓过了骆惊风手里的信，看着信上的徽章确实是属于凌家的徽章。凌飞扬拆开扫了一眼，眸色冷了下来。“我也收到了。”骆惊风淡淡的说道，“走吧。”“诸葛小姐，下次见。我有事情要处理。不要想我。”凌飞扬转头看着诸葛明月，露出了个魅惑的笑容。诸葛明月眼皮都没抬一下：“慢走不送。”那淡漠的态度让凌飞扬心中有些挫败感。他正要和骆惊风出门，诸葛明月却忽然又出声了。“喂，那个，凌飞扬是吧？”诸葛明月抬头看着凌飞扬和骆惊风的背影开口了。“何事？诸葛小姐？”凌飞扬露出个完美的笑容，转过头来，眼里透露的意思就是果然没有女人能抵挡自己的魅力啊。这次她可算把自己的名字记清楚了吧？“那个，你走之前，麻烦记得付账。”诸葛明月却面不改色的叮嘱着。凌飞扬脸上的笑容彻底的僵住。骆惊风在一旁勾起嘴角，耸肩道：“好了，惊风，走吧。时间紧迫，当然走之前，你要记得付账。”凌飞扬懊恼的猛然转头，急速离去。骆惊风笑着跟在了后面。诸葛明月没有再理会，而是继续吃肉……薛子皓和万俟辰对视一眼，两人都在对方眼里看到了惊讶和笑意。此刻一切都尽在不言中了，所以两人也埋头吃起来。用晚餐后，诸葛明月眯着眼满足的出了酒楼。“诸葛，记得啊，我的药水！”薛子皓叮嘱着。这次他可是下了血本啊。“记得。到时候给你五瓶药水，时效绝对让你满意。”诸葛明月保证着。“那好那好。那两天后我们学院门口见啊。”薛子皓乐滋滋的说道。“诸葛，到时候见啊。”万俟辰也和诸葛明月道别。……接下来的两天，诸葛明月就自己待在家里，捣鼓她的药水。这个世界的炼金技术不算先进。就连纯净水都无法提炼。诸葛明月倒腾出了蒸馏水，最为纯净的水。按照配方来炼制，最后炼制出来的药水，她总算满意了。现在就等假期完后的初级班的历练了。每一年，白羽学院都会举行这样的历练。初级班在几位老师的带领下，去城外三十里处的寻龙山脉历练。寻龙山脉，绵长广阔，贯穿七个国家。山脉中有各种凶兽，也有奇花异草，稀有的矿石等等。是个天然的宝藏，但是危险往往与利益成正比。越是往山脉深处，宝贝越多，但是越危险。每年白羽学院的历练，只会在外围。这天一大早，万俟辰和薛子皓就兴冲冲的等在了学院门口，万俟辰不断的探着脑袋望着街口。“行了，胖子，诸葛肯定会来的，你急个屁！”薛子皓看着胖子那猴急的样子，忍不住开口训斥他了。“你不急，你不急就不会在原地转圈十八次了。”万俟辰白了一眼薛子皓，没好气的说道。“嘿嘿，这不是，这不是等诸葛的药水嘛。她答应过今天给我五瓶药水的。”薛子皓搓着手不好意思的回答。“来了来了！”万俟辰嘿嘿一笑，看着出现在街口的诸葛明月，以迅雷不及掩耳之势就蹿出去迎接了。薛子皓也低呼一声等等我，就追上去了。“诸葛，诸葛，你来啦。这个给你，你肯定还没吃早饭。”万俟辰把手里装在油纸袋里的包子递给了诸葛明月。诸葛明月毫不客气的接过来，拿出包子就开始咬，含糊不清的说道：“嗯，呜，胖子，谢谢。”“不谢，不谢。”万俟辰摇着头憨憨的笑了笑。“诸葛，那个，那个……”薛子皓上前搓着手不好意思的说着，想了想又道，“对了，这次历练，我什么都准备了，放心放心。”“嗯，乖。这个给你，省着点用。现在我穷，买的材料只够炼制这么点了。”诸葛明月从背着的包里面掏出了几瓶药水递给了薛子皓。“哇，这么多！谢谢，谢谢。”薛子皓兴奋的接过来。居然有八瓶啊！而且看这个药水的颜色，就知道这些药水的时效随便都有十分钟了，还有一瓶颜色更深，应该不止十分钟。薛子皓高兴坏了，小心翼翼的把药水都放好后，才嘿嘿一笑，“我零花钱不多。全部贡献出来。这次历练我们去弄点材料，能用的就用，不能用的我们卖掉。”“我也是这个想法。”诸葛明月点头。“集合了，集合了，走。”万俟辰看着学院门口几个老师出现了，急忙出声提醒。“嗯，走吧。”诸葛明月把最后一个包子塞进了嘴里，和万俟辰还有薛子皓往校门口走去。这次参加历练的是全部初级班的学员，一共有一百七十八人。他们要一起到达寻龙山脉，然后自由组合。学院并不建议学员们独身进入山脉历练，都是让学员们自由组合成小队进入。但是有实力很强的学员自己坚持一个人进去，学院也不会阻止。一般来说，历练都是半个月。半个月后，在山脉的入口集合。如果遇到危险，就放出求救信号，带队的老师会最快的赶到救援。但是学员们都不会轻易求援，因为一旦求援，这次的历练成绩，就会被扣分，且扣的不轻。但是谁也没有想到，原本平常的历练，居然也会发生惊心动魄的剧变。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－手机留言的亲，我回复了你们用手机是看不到回复的。还有，那边的荣华文，我结局写好了，但是我是在台机写的。结果，台机似乎有病毒。稿子全部给我弄的乱七八糟的，昨晚整理到12点还没整理好，今天继续整理。悲剧啊……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 10 You are right, I am really just laughing. Zhuge Mingyue looked at the handsome man who slowly appeared at the door and frowned slightly. \"Miss Zhuge, I wonder if I would be honored to treat you to dinner?\" Ling Feiyang showed a charming and confident smile. \"Oh, who are you? What's your name, Ling or Ang?\" Zhuge Mingyue frowned and asked in confusion. The smile on Ling Feiyang's face froze, and then he regained his smile: \"This is Ling Feiyang. Lingyun Ling, Feiyun flying like lightning, famous.\" \"Oh.\" Zhuge Mingyue nodded matter-of-factly, and asked seriously, \"What's wrong with you?\" Ling Fei Yang smiled and said, \"I just want to treat Miss Zhuge to a meal.\" \"Oh, you're welcome, thank you. Fatty, Zihao, let's eat.\" After saying that, Zhuge Mingyue greeted Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao to eat, completely ignoring Ling Feiyang who was standing at the table. Wan Qichen glanced at Ling Feiyang, snorted softly, and started eating without ceremony. Xue Zihao hesitated and started eating. Ling Feiyang felt that the smile on his face could no longer hold on, but he still tried his best to hold on. But just standing at the table, watching Zhuge Mingyue and the other three enjoying the food, he still felt that he would lose his power if he continued like this. This is the first time someone doesn't give him face like this, the first time! The first time! \"Hehehe...\" A burst of joking laughter came from the door, and Luo Jingfeng with a stern face appeared at the door, leaning against the door, folding his hands on his chest, and looking at the scene inside teasingly. \"You're so ridiculous.\" Ling Feiyang squeezed out a few words through his teeth with a dark face. \"You're right, I'm really just laughing my ass off.\" Luo Jingfeng tilted his head and raised his eyebrows slightly. Ling Feiyang's face turned darker. Zhuge Mingyue turned back to look at the person at the door. Looking at Luo Jingfeng with a joking smile on his face, Zhuge Mingyue raised his eyebrows slightly. What this man said was interesting. \"That's Luo Jingfeng.\" Xue Zihao whispered to Zhuge Mingyue. \"Miss Zhuge, I'm sorry. My friend was too presumptuous, so I hope you can forgive me. This is Luo Jingfeng.\" Luo Jingfeng walked in slowly and spoke with a polite smile. Zhuge Mingyue narrowed her eyes slightly and looked at the person in front of her. She would not be polite to a self-righteous person like Ling Feiyang. However, she was embarrassed to face someone as polite as Luo Jingfeng. \"It doesn't matter.\" Zhuge Mingyue smiled slightly and nodded. \"Well, excuse me.\" Luo Jingfeng nodded to Zhuge Mingyue, walked to Ling Feiyang's side, took out an envelope, \"Yours.\" \"I told you not to accept love letters for me casually.\" Ling Feiyang frowned and snorted. \"It's an urgent letter from the Ling family.\" Luo Jingfeng said slowly and clearly, his voice neither loud nor quiet, but just enough for everyone in the room to hear clearly. \"Haha...\" Zhuge Mingyue laughed without any shame. This Luo Jingfeng was definitely intentional, hahaha! Ling Feiyang's face turned purple, and he grabbed the letter in Luo Jingfeng's hand and saw that the badge on the letter was indeed the badge of the Ling family. Ling Feiyang opened it and glanced at it, his eyes turned cold. \"I received it too.\" Luo Jingfeng said calmly, \"Let's go.\" \"Miss Zhuge, see you next time. I have something to deal with. Don't miss me.\" Ling Feiyang turned to look at Zhuge Mingyue and showed a charming smile. Zhuge Mingyue didn't even raise his eyelids: \"Let's go slowly without seeing him off.\" That indifferent attitude made Ling Feiyang feel a little frustrated. He was about to go out with Luo Jingfeng when Zhuge Mingyue suddenly spoke again. \"Hey, um, Ling Feiyang, right?\" Zhuge Mingyue looked up at the backs of Ling Feiyang and Luo Jingfeng and spoke. \"What's the matter? Miss Zhuge?\" Ling Feiyang showed a perfect smile and turned his head. The meaning in his eyes was that no woman could resist his charm. Did she remember her name clearly this time? \"Well, before you leave, please remember to pay the bill.\" Zhuge Mingyue warned without changing her expression. The smile on Ling Feiyang's face completely froze. Luo Jingfeng raised his lips and shrugged: \"Okay, Jingfeng, let's go. Time is running out, of course, you have to remember to pay the bill before leaving.\" Ling Feiyang suddenly turned his head in annoyance and left quickly. Luo Jingfeng smiled and followed behind. Zhuge Mingyue ignored it and continued to eat meat... Xue Zihao and Wan Qichen looked at each other, and they both saw surprise and smile in each other's eyes. At this moment, everything was lost in words, so the two of them buried themselves in eating. After dinner, Zhuge Mingyue left the restaurant with squinted eyes and satisfaction. \"Zhuge, remember, my potion!\" Xue Zihao warned. This time he spent a lot of money. \"Remember. I will give you five bottles of potion when the time comes, and the effect will definitely satisfy you.\" Zhuge Mingyue promised. \"Okay, okay. Let's meet at the gate of the college in two days.\" Xue Zihao said happily. \"Zhuge, see you then.\" Wan Qichen also said goodbye to Zhuge Mingyue. ...In the next two days, Zhuge Mingyue stayed at home by herself, tinkering with her potion. The alchemy technology in this world is not advanced. Even pure water cannot be refined. Zhuge Mingyue poured out distilled water, the purest water. After refining it according to the formula, she was finally satisfied with the final potion. Now we are waiting for the experience of the junior class after the holidays. Every year, Baiyu Academy holds such an experience. The junior class, led by several teachers, went to the Xunlong Mountains thirty miles outside the city to practice. The Xunlong Mountains are long and vast, running through seven countries. There are all kinds of ferocious beasts in the mountains, as well as exotic flowers and plants, rare ores and so on. It is a natural treasure, but the danger is often directly proportional to the benefit. The deeper you go into the mountains, the more treasures there are, but the more dangerous they are. Every year, the experience of Baiyu Academy will only be on the periphery. Early that morning, Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao were waiting excitedly at the entrance of the college. Wan Qichen kept looking at the street with his head raised. \"Okay, fat man, Zhuge Ken", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}